  "question": {
    "html": "<p>Jim runs with a constant velocity <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"v\"></span> past Sally who is at rest. At this instant, Sally begins to chase Jim with constant acceleration <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"a\"></span>.</p>\n<p>Which expression gives the time Sally will catch Jim?<br/><br/></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{v}{2a}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{v}{a}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{2v}{a}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{4v}{a}\"></span></li></ol>"
